{
  "_comment": "ai_grid.v1.Model in protojson: the subset of a KServe LLMInferenceService (serving.kserve.io/v1alpha2) the console writes, plus an optional placement (an ACM Placement and ManifestWorkReplicaSet named model-<name>, labelled ai-grid/model=<name>; generated works are named model-<name><5 characters>, no separator). Shapes follow the hub instance in mock/research/models-maas.md 2.1 (baseRefs, model.uri/name, replicas, router with the product-default openshift-ai-inference Gateway, a managed route and the scheduler, a main container with resources and env). status is derived by the server on every read and must not be written here: the LLMInferenceService conditions from the creation time and the lifecycle in bff/internal/fakebackend/kserve.go, the Placement decisions from the current clusters, the works from the rollout. A model without creationTimestamp is created when the fake starts, so its rollout can be watched live. Five fictional models: tiny-llm, a Ready CPU model on the hub; granite-8b-instruct, placed (All) on the enrolled and provisioned sites with the rollout complete on site-paris-1 at start; site-madrid-1 joins when its lease recovers at 300s (scenarios.json), the model reads pending until madrid's work is Ready at 345s and is then Ready on two sites; mistral-7b-instruct, a live Progressive rollout one OpenShift spoke at a time (maxConcurrency 1, minSuccessTime 30s) in cluster-name order: site-frankfurt-1 at start (Ready at 45s, its slot frees at 75s), site-berlin-1 (joins at 20s) at 75s, site-paris-1 at 150s, Ready at 195s, then site-madrid-1 at 300s, which sends it back to pending until 345s; llama-3-70b, failed on a preset this hub does not have (ConfigNotFound); codellama-13b, whose placement selects no cluster (NoManagedClusterMatched, PlacementVerified and ManifestworkApplied PlacementDecisionEmpty, PlacementRolledOut Complete for the empty decision). bindings names the ManagedClusterSets bound into each model namespace; a namespace not listed is bound to global, an empty list is a namespace without a ManagedClusterSetBinding (PlacementSatisfied=False/NoManagedClusterSetBindings). All values are fictional.",
  "bindings": {
    "ai-grid-models": ["global"],
    "unbound-models": []
  },
  "models": [
    {
      "name": "tiny-llm",
      "metadata": {
